    ! #223: "The assistant no longer asks for confirmation after you have already requested a change, including after correcting an earlier mistake. You can rely on it to report a change only after a tool call succeeds" - PR #223 added these rules to the system prompt and verified a live scenario. It does not establish that the assistant will always follow them; the wording presents model behavior as guaranteed.

